extends /template/newsentry.pug

block newsvariables
  - var newskey = '2010-05-18-contributions-at-the-agile-conference-2010';

//-
  block date
    | [date]

  block title
    | [title]

block newscontent
  p.card-text
  p The paper "Automated Image-Based Abstraction of Aerial Images" has been presented at the international conference AGILE 2010. It is authored by the Master student Amir Semmo and his advisor Jan-Eric Kyprianidis. At the same conference, Jan Klimke presented his paper "Geospatial Annotations for 3D Environments and their WFS-based Implementation". The proceedings are available as book in the Springer series "Lecture Notes in Geoinformation and Cartography".
